  "bio": "Artists\nSuppliers\nAbout\nAt Jorga Cal Tattoo, discover an artistic haven nestled in Arteixo, A Coruña, where creativity meets precision. Specializing in illustrative, geometric, and dotwork tattoos, our expert artists — @dirtyrags_ and @jorgacaltattoo — transform your ideas into stunning body art. Book your session with us via direct message and embark on a journey of self-expression like no other.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location:\n\n▪️Estudio de tatuajes en Arteixo (A Coruña)\n▪️Tatuador:⚜️ @dirtyrags_ \n▪️Tatuadora:⚜️ @farinastattoo\n▪️Para citas mensaje directo",
